  "body": "An exceptional opportunity for developers, builders and investors to secure a substantial 926m² (more or less) flat corner site in a highly desirable coastal location, complete with extensive consenting already in place.\r\n\r\nZoned Mixed Housing Suburban, complete with Resource Consent (RC), Building Consent (BC), and EPA approval for the construction of three modern standalone five-bedroom homes. \r\n\r\nThe elevated appeal is enhanced by fantastic harbour views, while the flat corner configuration provides an attractive foundation for three substantial family homes in an established and highly sought-after neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nThe property is within walking distance of Half Moon Bay Ferry Terminal and only a few minutes' drive from Highland Park Shopping Centre and Lloyd Elsmore Park. Families are particularly well catered for, with zoning for some of East Auckland's most sought-after schools, including Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, Bucklands Beach Primary School and Pigeon Mountain School.\r\n\r\nWith the consenting pathway substantially advanced and key infrastructure already on site, opportunities of this calibre are seldom available.\r\n\r\nMortgagee sale conditions apply. Prospective purchasers are advised to undertake their own due diligence regarding the property, existing approvals, consents and proposed development.\r\n\r\nTender closing 4pm, Thursday, 10th September 2026.",
